SUMMARY:Flower Festival - Cherry-Crest Adventure Farm
DESCRIPTION:Our sunflower and zinnia fields come alive with vibrant blooms and endless smiles!\nCome join us for a day of sunshine and floral fun at the Sunflower Festival\, where the beauty of nature meets the excitement of adventure on the farm. It’s an experience that will fill your heart with joy and your camera roll with stunning memories! \nFestival Highlights:\n\nFlowers Sold by Stem or Bucket\nLocal Craft Vendors\nKids Craft\nPhoto Ops\nBalloon Artist (1-4pm)\nWinery & Brewery\nLive Music\n\nand much more for the entire family to enjoy. \n\n\nFarm: 10am – 7pm\nFestival Activities: 10am – 6pm\n\n\nAdditional Fun Things To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nKids’ Attractions\nFamily Attractions\nAmish Attractions\n\n\n\nThings To Do for Adults\nHistorical & Educational\nIndoor Things To Do\n\n\n\nTheater\, Music\, & The Arts\nMud Sales\nEvents Calendar\n\n \nTake a look at many more Things To Do throughout Lancaster County!
