SUMMARY:Live Music with Tropical Sunz at Cherry Crest Adventure Farm
DESCRIPTION:Check out our amazing line up of musicians that will be performing live right here at the farm! \nJoin us select Friday evenings and Saturdays for toe tapping tunes from our favorite bands. \nWhat is Jawaiaan music? Combining Hawaiian\, Reggae\, Blues\, Rock and Caribbean vibed covers of your favorite tunes! \nEnjoy feel good Island Music! Unique Electric Ukulele driven fun! \n\nAdditional Fun Things To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nKids’ Attractions\nFamily Attractions\nAmish Attractions\n\n\n\nThings To Do for Adults\nHistorical & Educational\nIndoor Things To Do\n\n\n\nTheater\, Music\, & The Arts\nMud Sales\nEvents Calendar\n\n \nTake a look at many more Things To Do throughout Lancaster County!
